function people(){return heading('成员管理','64 位成员',modalbtn('导入成员','import','','upload')+goto('邀请成员','invitations','primary','plus'))+`<div class="page-tools"><div class="segmented"><button class="active">全部成员 <span>64</span></button><button>已启用 <span>61</span></button><button>已停用 <span>3</span></button></div>${search('搜索成员…')}${modalbtn('筛选','filters','','filter')}</div>${table([check(false),'成员','所属部门','身份','加入时间','状态',''],members.map((n,i)=>[check(false),`<div>${person(n,'a'+i%4)}<div style="font-size:10px;color:#aaa0b4;padding-left:35px;margin-top:5px">${['yufan','siyuan','linxiao','zhiyan','yuan','yining','guyan','suxiao','luming','chengyue'][i]}@example.com</div></div>`,['产品研发部','产品研发部','财务部','行政部','人事部'][i%5],badge(i===0?'管理员':i===2?'财务专员':'普通成员','outline'),'2026 / 09 / '+String(14+i),badge('已启用','done'),modalbtn('编辑','member','','edit')]))}${pagination(64)}`}
function departments(){return heading('部门分组','6 个部门',modalbtn('新建部门','new-group','primary','plus'))+`<div class="grid2"><div class="card" style="padding:12px 17px"><div class="tree-row">${icon('down')}${icon('folder')}Weave 工作空间<span class="push">64 人</span></div>${[['产品研发部','18'],['产品组','6'],['研发组','12'],['人事部','8'],['财务部','6'],['行政部','10'],['市场与销售部','22']].map(([n,c],i)=>`<div class="tree-row ${i===1||i===2?'indent':''}" style="${i===0?'background:#f7f3fc;border-radius:7px':''}">${icon(i===0?'down':'right')}${icon('folder')}${n}<span class="push">${c} 人</span><button class="dots" data-modal="new-group">${icon('more')}</button></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="card"><div class="card-top"><h2>产品研发部</h2>${modalbtn('添加成员','approvers','','plus')}</div>${members.slice(0,6).map((n,i)=>`<div class="list-item">${person(n,'a'+i%4)}<span class="push muted" style="font-size:10px">${i===0?'负责人':'成员'}</span>${modalbtn('移动','new-group')}</div>`).join('')}</div></div>`}
function templates(type){let identity=type==='identities';return heading(identity?'身份模板':'权限模板',identity?'5 个身份':'4 个模板',modalbtn(identity?'新建身份':'新建模板','new-group','primary','plus'))+`<div class="grid3">${(identity?[['空间管理员','全部管理权限','2 位成员'],['部门主管','人员管理、应用创建','8 位成员'],['人事专员','人员管理','6 位成员'],['财务专员','应用访问','4 位成员'],['普通成员','基础访问','44 位成员']]:[['管理员权限','人员管理、应用创建','全部权限'],['人事管理权限','成员、部门与身份','人员管理'],['应用创建权限','创建与管理本人应用','创建应用'],['基础权限','工作台与已授权应用','基础访问']]).map(([n,d,c],i)=>`<div class="card app-card" data-modal="permission-template"><span class="appmark ${i===0?'accent':''}">${icon(identity?'users':'shield')}</span><button class="pin" aria-label="编辑模板">${icon('edit')}</button><h2>${n}</h2><p>${d}</p><div class="bottom">${c}</div></div>`).join('')}</div>`}
function invitations(){return heading('邀请码','8 个有效邀请码',modalbtn('生成邀请码','invite','primary','plus'))+`<div class="page-tools"><div class="segmented"><button class="active">未使用</button><button>已使用</button><button>已失效</button></div>${search('搜索邀请码…')}</div>${table(['邀请码','预设身份','所属部门','生成时间','有效期',''],['WX7P · 8K2M','HF4N · 3T9Q','AY6R · 2B8C','KP3S · 7D4V','MN9T · 5F2A','QR2W · 8J6H'].map((c,i)=>[`<span style="font-family:monospace;letter-spacing:2px;color:#756481">${c}</span>`,badge(i===0?'人事专员':'普通成员','outline'),['人事部','产品研发部','财务部'][i%3],'2026 / 10 / 05','2026 / 10 / 12',btn('复制','data-copy="'+c+'"','','link')]))}`}
function audit(){return heading('审计日志','最近 30 天',btn('导出','data-export="true"','','download'))+`<div class="page-tools"><div class="segmented"><button class="active">全部操作</button><button>人员</button><button>应用</button><button>安全</button></div>${search('搜索操作…')}${modalbtn('筛选','filters','','filter')}</div>${table(['时间','操作人','操作','对象','结果'],[['14:32:08','林晓','修改记录','报销申请 / BX-2026-0086'],['14:20:46','梁宇凡','发布流程','财务管理 / 报销审批 v3'],['13:56:21','梁宇凡','保存表单','财务管理 / 报销申请'],['11:42:15','陈思远','审批通过','请假申请 / LV-2026-0124'],['10:18:32','梁宇凡','调整应用权限','人事管理 / 人事专员'],['09:42:03','苏晓','提交记录','请假申请 / LV-2026-0128'],['09:25:44','梁宇凡','邀请成员','产品研发部'],['09:12:09','梁宇凡','登录','工作空间']].map(([d,n,a,o])=>[`<span style="color:#a698b3;font-size:11px">2026 / 10 / 05 <span style="margin-left:9px">${d}</span></span>`,person(n),a,o,badge('成功','done')]))}`}
function auth(register=false){return `<div class="auth-shell"><div class="auth-aside"><div class="auth-brand"><span class="logo">w</span>WeaveOS</div><div class="auth-visual"><div class="auth-tile"><span class="appmark accent">${icon('layers')}</span><div><strong>把工作，连接起来</strong><small>应用 · 数据 · 流程</small></div></div><div class="auth-tile"><span class="appmark">${icon('file')}</span><div><strong>属于你的工作空间</strong><small>从一张表单开始</small></div><span class="push">${icon('check')}</span></div><div class="auth-tile"><span class="appmark">${icon('flow')}</span><div><strong>让协作自然发生</strong><small>每一步，都清晰可见</small></div></div></div></div><div class="auth-content"><div class="auth-box"><h1>${register?'加入工作空间':'欢迎回来'}</h1><p>${register?'创建你的 WeaveOS 账号':'登录你的 WeaveOS 账号'}</p>${register?field('用户名','',{input:true}):''}${field(register?'邮箱':'邮箱或用户名','',{input:true})}${field('密码','',{input:true})}${register?field('邀请码','',{input:true}):'<div class="row between" style="font-size:11px;color:#a695b3"><label>'+check(false)+' 保持登录</label><button data-modal="password">忘记密码</button></div>'}${goto(register?'创建账号':'登录','home','primary') }<div class="auth-switch">${register?'已有账号？':'还没有账号？'}<a href="#${register?'login':'register'}">${register?'登录':'使用邀请码注册'}</a></div></div><div class="auth-foot">WeaveOS · 让工作简单有序</div></div></div>`}
const pages={home,apps,application,records:recordsPage,record:recordDetail,'new-record':newRecord,'form-builder':designer,flows,'flow-builder':flowDesigner,inbox,approval,started,history,permissions:()=>permissions(false),'data-permissions':()=>permissions(true),'app-settings':appSettings,members:people,departments,identities:()=>templates('identities'),'permission-templates':()=>templates('permissions'),invitations,audit};
function render(){clearTimeout(window.toastTimer);if($('#toast'))$('#toast').style.display='none';const [r,query='']=location.hash.slice(1).split('?');route=screenNames[r]?r:'home';document.title='WeaveOS · '+screenNames[route];$('#root').innerHTML=['login','register'].includes(route)?auth(route==='register'):`<div class="app ${closed?'closed':''}" id="app"><aside class="sidebar">${sidebar()}</aside><main class="main">${topbar()}${tabs()}<section class="body route-enter ${['form-builder','flow-builder'].includes(route)?'editor-main':''}" id="pageBody">${pages[route]()}</section></main></div>`;bind();let m=new URLSearchParams(query).get('modal');if(m)openModal(m);window.__readyRoute=route;}
function navigate(next){if(['form-builder','flow-builder','new-record'].includes(next)&&!['form-builder','flow-builder','new-record'].includes(route))returnTo=route;location.hash=next;}
function toast(text){$('#toast').textContent=text;$('#toast').style.display='block';clearTimeout(window.toastTimer);window.toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>$('#toast').style.display='none',2600)}
function saveLocal(kind){try{localStorage.setItem('weaveos-prototype-'+kind,JSON.stringify({at:new Date().toISOString(),route,values:$$('#pageBody .field input,#pageBody .field textarea,#pageBody .field select').map(e=>({label:e.getAttribute('aria-label')||e.closest('.field')?.querySelector('label')?.textContent.trim(),value:e.value})),designMarkup:kind==='design'?$('.paper')?.innerHTML:undefined}));toast('已保存到当前浏览器 · HTML 原型')}catch{toast('当前浏览器无法保存，请检查存储设置')}}
function bind(){bindAccountMenu();const close=$('#closeSidebar'),open=$('#openSidebar');if(close)close.onclick=()=>{closed=true;render()};if(open)open.onclick=()=>{closed=false;render();$('#closeSidebar')?.focus({preventScroll:true})};try{const saved=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('weaveos-prototype-draft')||'null');if(route==='new-record'&&saved?.values){$$('#pageBody .field input,#pageBody .field textarea,#pageBody .field select').forEach(e=>{const key=e.getAttribute('aria-label')||e.closest('.field')?.querySelector('label')?.textContent.trim(),v=saved.values.find(v=>v.label===key);if(v)e.value=v.value})}}catch{}const s=$('#localSearch');if(s)s.oninput=()=>{if(route==='records')$('#recordTable').innerHTML=recordTable(records.filter(r=>r.join('').includes(s.value)));else $$('.generic tbody tr,.app-card').forEach(e=>e.hidden=!e.textContent.includes(s.value));};$$('[data-add-field]').forEach(e=>e.ondragstart=ev=>ev.dataTransfer.setData('text/plain',e.dataset.addField));const drop=$('#dropField');if(drop){drop.ondragover=e=>e.preventDefault();drop.ondrop=e=>{e.preventDefault();addField(e.dataTransfer.getData('text/plain'))}}if($('#fieldName'))$('#fieldName').oninput=e=>{const l=$('.design-field.active label');if(l)l.firstChild.textContent=e.target.value};$$('input[aria-label="密码"]').forEach(e=>e.type='password');}
function bindAccountMenu(){
 const trigger=$('#accountTrigger'),menu=$('#accountMenu');if(!trigger||!menu)return;
 trigger.onclick=()=>{if(menu.matches(':popover-open')){menu.hidePopover();return}const r=trigger.getBoundingClientRect();menu.style.left=Math.max(10,r.left)+'px';menu.style.bottom=(innerHeight-r.top+8)+'px';menu.showPopover();menu.querySelector('[role="menuitem"]')?.focus({preventScroll:true})};
 menu.addEventListener('toggle',e=>trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(e.newState==='open')));
 menu.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{const items=[...menu.querySelectorAll('[role="menuitem"]')],i=items.indexOf(document.activeElement);if(['ArrowDown','ArrowUp','Home','End'].includes(e.key)){e.preventDefault();const next=e.key==='Home'?0:e.key==='End'?items.length-1:(i+(e.key==='ArrowDown'?1:-1)+items.length)%items.length;items[next].focus()}if(e.key==='Escape'){e.preventDefault();menu.hidePopover();trigger.focus({preventScroll:true})}});
 menu.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target.closest('[role="menuitem"]'))menu.hidePopover()});
}
function addField(name){if(!name)return;const el=document.createElement('div');el.className='field design-field full';el.dataset.selectField=name;el.innerHTML=`<label>${esc(name)}</label><input placeholder="请输入">`;$('.paper .form-grid')?.append(el);toast('已添加 '+name)}
function openModal(name,source){const rect=source?.getBoundingClientRect();const modal=$('#modal');modal.className='modal '+(['filter-editor','preview','evidence'].includes(name)?'wide':'');modal.innerHTML=modalContent(name);modal.dataset.name=name;modal.style.setProperty('--origin-x',rect?((rect.x+rect.width/2-innerWidth/2))+'px':'0px');modal.style.setProperty('--origin-y',rect?((rect.y+rect.height/2-innerHeight/2))+'px':'12px');modal.style.setProperty('--origin-scale',rect?Math.max(.08,Math.min(.3,rect.width/(modal.classList.contains('wide')?740:570))):.96);if(!modal.open)modal.showModal();modal.classList.remove('dialog-enter');void modal.offsetWidth;modal.classList.add('dialog-enter');}
function closeModal(){const m=$('#modal');if(!m.open)return Promise.resolve();if(matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches){m.close();return Promise.resolve()}const a=m.animate([{opacity:1,transform:'translate(0,0) scale(1)'},{opacity:0,transform:'translate(var(--origin-x,0px),var(--origin-y,12px)) scale(var(--origin-scale,.96))'}],{duration:210,easing:'cubic-bezier(.4,0,.8,.3)',fill:'forwards'});return a.finished.catch(()=>{}).then(()=>{m.close();a.cancel()})}
function dialog(title,body,footer=''){return `<div class="dialog-top"><h2>${title}</h2><button class="iconbutton" data-close="true" aria-label="关闭">${icon('close')}</button></div>${body}<div class="buttons">${btn('取消','data-close="true"')}${footer}</div>`}
function modalContent(name){switch(name){case'save-required':return dialog('先保存修改','<p class="muted" style="line-height:1.9">保存当前修改后，再继续审批。</p>',btn('保存修改','data-save-before-approve="true"','primary'));case'filters':return dialog('自定义筛选',`<div class="filter-saved active" data-filter-choice="我关注的申请"><span class="radio"></span><div><strong>我关注的申请</strong><small>审批状态 = 审批中 · 申请人 = 我</small></div><button class="push iconbutton" data-modal="filter-editor" aria-label="编辑筛选">${icon('edit')}</button></div><div class="filter-saved" data-filter-choice="本月请假"><span class="radio"></span><div><strong>本月请假</strong><small>开始时间 ≥ 2026 / 10 / 01</small></div><button class="push iconbutton" data-modal="filter-editor" aria-label="编辑筛选">${icon('edit')}</button></div><div class="filter-saved" data-filter-choice="部门长假"><span class="radio"></span><div><strong>部门长假</strong><small>时长 > 3 天 · 所属部门 = 产品研发部</small></div></div><button class="softbutton" data-modal="filter-editor">${icon('plus')} 新建筛选</button>`,btn('应用筛选','data-apply-filter="true"','primary'));case'filter-editor':return dialog('编辑筛选',`${field('筛选名称','我关注的申请',{input:true})}<div class="filter-group"><div class="join"><span class="pill">且 AND</span>满足以下全部条件</div>${filterRow('审批状态','等于','审批中')}<div class="filter-group nested"><div class="join"><span class="pill">或 OR</span>满足以下任一条件</div>${filterRow('申请人','等于','梁宇凡')}${filterRow('所属部门','等于','产品研发部')}<div id="extraConditions"></div><button class="softbutton" data-add-condition="true">${icon('plus')} 添加或条件</button></div><button class="softbutton" data-add-and="true">${icon('plus')} 添加且条件</button></div>`,btn('保存筛选','data-save-filter="true"','primary'));case'columns':return dialog('显示字段',`<div class="columns-grid">${['申请事由','申请人','请假类型','请假日期','时长','审批状态','所属部门','提交时间'].map((n,i)=>`<label><input class="check" type="checkbox" data-column="${i}" ${hiddenColumns.has(i)?'':'checked'}>${n}</label>`).join('')}</div>`,btn('完成','data-columns-done="true"','primary'));case'sort':return dialog('排序',`<div class="filter-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr"> <select id="sortField"><option>时长</option><option>请假日期</option><option>提交时间</option></select><select id="sortDirection"><option>从大到小</option><option>从小到大</option></select></div>`,btn('应用','data-sort="true"','primary'));case'new-app':return dialog('新建应用',`${field('应用名称','',{input:true})}${field('所属分组','企业管理',{input:true})}<div class="field"><label>应用图标</label><div class="row">${['users','wallet','briefcase','folder','layers'].map(i=>`<button class="appmark ${i==='users'?'accent':''}" data-pick-icon="true">${icon(i)}</button>`).join('')}</div></div>`,btn('创建','data-local-action="应用已创建"','primary'));case'new-group':return dialog('新建分组',field('名称','',{input:true})+field('上级分组','企业管理',{input:true}),btn('保存','data-local-action="分组已保存"','primary'));case'import':return dialog('导入应用模板',`<div class="attachment" style="height:145px;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column">${icon('upload')}<span>选择 .weave 模板文件</span><label class="control" style="display:inline-flex;color:#7e718e;margin:0">选择文件<input type="file" accept=".json,.weave" style="position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;opacity:0"></label></div><div class="field"><label>人员与权限映射</label><select><option>导入后配置</option></select></div><div class="property-row">导入后启用流程 ${toggle(false)}</div>`,btn('导入','data-local-action="模板已载入原型"','primary'));case'preview':return dialog('表单预览',`<div class="form-card">${expenseForm(true)}</div>`,btn('完成','data-close="true"','primary'));case'add-node':return dialog('添加节点',`<div class="grid2">${['审批','条件分支'].map((n,i)=>`<button class="card row" data-add-node="${n}">${icon(i?'branch':'shield')}${n}</button>`).join('')}</div>`);case'approvers':return dialog('选择成员',`${search('搜索成员…')}<div style="margin-top:17px">${members.slice(0,5).map((n,i)=>`<label class="list-item" style="margin:0">${check(i===2)}${person(n)}<span class="push small-label">${['产品研发部','产品研发部','财务部','行政部','人事部'][i]}</span></label>`).join('')}</div>`,btn('确定','data-close="true"','primary'));case'permission-template':return dialog('权限配置',`${field('模板名称','人事管理权限',{input:true})}${['人员管理','创建应用'].map((n,i)=>`<div class="setting-row">${n}${toggle(i<2)}</div>`).join('')}`,btn('保存','data-save-dialog="true"','primary'));case'invite':return dialog('生成邀请码',`${field('数量','5',{input:true})}${field('预设身份','普通成员',{input:true})}${field('所属部门','产品研发部',{input:true})}<div class="field"><label>有效期</label><select><option>7 天</option><option>30 天</option></select></div>`,btn('生成','data-local-action="演示邀请码已生成"','primary'));case'member':return dialog('编辑成员',field('姓名','林晓',{input:true})+field('部门','财务部',{input:true})+field('身份','财务专员',{input:true}),btn('保存','data-save-dialog="true"','primary'));case'evidence':return dialog('审批依据 · v1',`<div class="row" style="color:#a394b0;font-size:11px;margin-bottom:23px">陈思远 · 部门经理 · 今天 10:18</div>${expenseForm().replace('2,480.00','2,560.00')}`,btn('关闭','data-close="true"','primary'));case'agree':case'reject':case'return':case'withdraw':case'submit':return dialog({agree:'同意申请',reject:'驳回申请',return:'退回节点',withdraw:'撤回申请',submit:'提交报销申请'}[name],`${name==='return'?'<div class="field"><label>退回至</label><select><option>部门经理 · 本轮已审批</option></select></div>':''}${name==='submit'?'<div class="row" style="padding:15px 0;font-size:12px">'+icon('flow')+'报销审批 · 部门经理 → 财务审批</div>':'<div class="field"><label>备注</label><textarea class="input" rows="3" placeholder="填写备注"></textarea></div>'}`,btn('确认','data-confirm-action="'+name+'"','primary'));case'search':return dialog('搜索工作空间',`<div class="searchbox" style="width:100%">${icon('search')}<input style="width:100%;height:40px" placeholder="搜索应用、表单或记录" autofocus></div><div class="section-row">最近访问</div>${['人事管理','请假申请','报销审批'].map((n,i)=>`<div class="list-item" data-go="${['application','records','flows'][i]}">${icon(i===2?'flow':'file')} ${n}<span class="push muted">${icon('right')}</span></div>`).join('')}`);case'share':return dialog('分享应用',`<div class="setting-row">访问范围<span class="pill">按应用权限</span></div><div class="input" style="margin-top:20px;color:#a194ac">weaveos.local / apps / personnel</div>`,btn('复制链接','data-copy="weaveos.local/apps/personnel"','primary'));case'password':return dialog('重置密码','<p style="color:#93859f;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9">请联系工作空间管理员重置密码。</p>',btn('知道了','data-close="true"','primary'));case'app-menu':return dialog('应用管理',`<div class="stack">${goto('应用设置','app-settings','','settings')}${goto('权限管理','permissions','','shield')}${goto('审批流程','flows','','flow')}</div>`);case'record-menu':return dialog('记录操作',`<div class="stack">${goto('查看详情','record','','file')}${goto('编辑记录','new-record','','edit')}${goto('查看历史','history','','clock')}</div>`);default:return dialog('WeaveOS','<p class="muted" style="line-height:1.9">这是可交互的高保真 HTML 原型，使用演示数据。</p>',btn('关闭','data-close="true"','primary'));}}
function filterRow(a,b,c){return `<div class="filter-row"><select><option>${a}</option><option>时长</option><option>申请人</option></select><select><option>${b}</option><option>不等于</option>${['时长','请假日期','提交时间'].includes(a)?'<option>大于</option><option>小于</option>':''}</select><input value="${c}"><button class="iconbutton" data-remove-condition="true" aria-label="删除条件">${icon('close')}</button></div>`}
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{let el=e.target.closest('button,[data-go],[data-filter-choice]');if(!el)return;if(el.dataset.go){closeModal();navigate(el.dataset.go);return}if(el.dataset.modal){if(el.dataset.modal==='agree'&&recordDirty){openModal('save-required',el);return}openModal(el.dataset.modal,el);return}if(el.dataset.close){closeModal();return}if(el.dataset.exit){navigate(returnTo);return}if(el.dataset.save){saveLocal(el.dataset.save);if(el.dataset.save==='record')recordDirty=false;return}if(el.dataset.saveDialog){saveLocal('settings');closeModal();return}if(el.dataset.localAction){saveLocal('demo');closeModal();return}if(el.dataset.pin){e.stopPropagation();el.classList.toggle('active');el.setAttribute('aria-label',el.classList.contains('active')?'取消固定':'固定应用');return}if(el.classList.contains('toggle')){el.classList.toggle('on');el.setAttribute('aria-checked',el.classList.contains('on'));return}if(el.dataset.filterChoice){$$('.filter-saved').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));el.classList.add('active');return}if(el.dataset.applyFilter){activeFilter=$('.filter-saved.active strong')?.textContent||'我关注的申请';closeModal();render();if(route==='records')$('#recordTable').innerHTML=recordTable(records.filter(r=>r[1]==='梁宇凡'&&r[5]==='审批中'));return}if(el.dataset.saveFilter){saveLocal('filters');openModal('filters');return}if(el.dataset.addCondition){$('#extraConditions').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',filterRow('申请人','不等于',''));return}if(el.dataset.addAnd){$('.filter-group').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',filterRow('时长','大于','3'));return}if(el.dataset.removeCondition){el.closest('.filter-row').remove();return}if(el.dataset.columnsDone){$$('[data-column]').forEach(x=>x.checked?hiddenColumns.delete(+x.dataset.column):hiddenColumns.add(+x.dataset.column));closeModal();$$('.generic tr').forEach(tr=>[...tr.children].forEach((td,i)=>td.hidden=hiddenColumns.has(i-1)));return}if(el.dataset.sort){const desc=$('#sortDirection').selectedIndex===0;const sorted=[...records].sort((a,b)=>(parseFloat(a[4])-parseFloat(b[4]))*(desc?-1:1));closeModal();if(route==='records')$('#recordTable').innerHTML=recordTable(sorted);return}if(el.dataset.addField){addField(el.dataset.addField);return}if(el.dataset.addNode){closeModal();const target=$('.flow-track');if(target)target.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<div class="connector"></div><div class="flow-node" data-select-node="${el.dataset.addNode}"><strong>${el.dataset.addNode}</strong><small>点击配置节点</small></div>`);return}if(el.dataset.removeField){$('.design-field.active')?.remove();return}if(el.dataset.saveBeforeApprove){saveLocal('record');recordDirty=false;openModal('agree');return}if(el.dataset.confirmAction){closeModal();toast('原型演示：操作完成，未提交到服务器');return}if(el.dataset.copy){navigator.clipboard?.writeText(el.dataset.copy).then(()=>toast('已复制')).catch(()=>toast('请手动复制：'+el.dataset.copy));return}if(el.dataset.export){const data=JSON.stringify({prototype:true,name:'人事管理',forms:['请假申请','加班申请'],flowsEnabled:false},null,2),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([data],{type:'application/json'}));a.download='WeaveOS-demo-template.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href),1000);return}if(el.dataset.segment){$$('[data-segment]').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));el.classList.add('active');if(route==='records')$('#recordTable').innerHTML=recordTable(records.filter(r=>el.dataset.segment==='all'||(el.dataset.segment==='mine'?r[1]==='梁宇凡':r[5]==='审批中')));return}if(el.dataset.page){$$('.page').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));el.classList.add('active');toast('演示数据 · 第 '+(parseInt(el.dataset.page)||2)+' 页');return}if(el.dataset.pickIcon){$$('[data-pick-icon]').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('accent'));el.classList.add('accent');return}if(el.dataset.undo){toast('原型演示：撤销入口');return}});
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{let f=e.target.closest('[data-select-field]');if(f){selectedField=f.dataset.selectField;$$('.design-field').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x===f));$('#fieldName').value=selectedField}let n=e.target.closest('[data-select-node]');if(n){selectedNode=n.dataset.selectNode;$$('.flow-node').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('selected',x===n));$('.properties h2').textContent=selectedNode;$('.properties input').value=selectedNode}});
$('#modal').addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target===$('#modal')){let r=e.target.getBoundingClientRect();if(e.clientX<r.left||e.clientX>r.right||e.clientY<r.top||e.clientY>r.bottom)closeModal()}});
$('#modal').addEventListener('cancel',e=>{e.preventDefault();closeModal()});
document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if((e.ctrlKey||e.metaKey)&&e.key==='k'){e.preventDefault();openModal('search')}});
document.addEventListener('change',e=>{if(e.target.matches('.filter-row select:first-child')){let op=e.target.nextElementSibling;op.innerHTML=['等于','不等于',...(['时长','请假日期','提交时间'].includes(e.target.value)?['大于','小于']:[])].map(v=>'<option>'+v+'</option>').join('')}});
document.addEventListener('input',e=>{if(route==='approval'&&e.target.closest('#pageBody .field'))recordDirty=true});
addEventListener('hashchange',render);render();
